<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 3.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 3.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 03     June 02   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  275.160     274.530     247.020   11.39 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  310.990     310.810     306.830    1.36 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.400     159.575     158.970    0.27 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.280	47.220	47.182    0.21 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  449.500     449.580     419.180    7.23 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.670     141.795     141.685   -0.01 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.196	16.157	16.185    0.07 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  237.250     235.870     212.430   11.68 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.886	 1.888	 1.888   -0.11 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.578	 1.576	 1.581   -0.19 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  192.255     192.580     183.135    4.98 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
